@startuml
!theme cerulean-outline
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Secuencia: Login de Usuario

actor Usuario as User #4A90E2
participant "Frontend\n(React)" as Frontend #50C878
participant "Backend\n(NestJS)" as Backend #FF6B6B
database "PostgreSQL" as DB #FFB347

autonumber

User -> Frontend: Ingresa email y contraseña
activate Frontend

User -> Frontend: Click "Iniciar Sesión"

Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/auth/login\n{email, password}
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: SELECT * FROM usuarios\nWHERE email = ?
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Usuario encontrado
deactivate DB

Backend -> Backend: bcrypt.compare(\npassword,\npassword_hash)
note right: Verifica contraseña\ncon hash bcrypt\ncost factor 12

alt Password válido
    Backend -> Backend: Generar JWT\npayload: {id, email, rol}
    note right: Token expira\nen 24 horas

    Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK\n{access_token, user}
    deactivate Backend

    Frontend -> Frontend: Guardar token en\nlocalStorage
    Frontend -> Frontend: Actualizar AuthContext\n{user, token, isAuth: true}

    Frontend --> User: Redirigir a Dashboard\nsegún rol
    deactivate Frontend

else Password inválido
    Backend --> Frontend: 401 Unauthorized\n{message: "Credenciales inválidas"}
    deactivate Backend

    Frontend --> User: Mostrar error:\n"Email o contraseña incorrectos"
    deactivate Frontend
end

note over User, DB
  **Seguridad Implementada:**
  • Contraseñas hasheadas con bcrypt
  • JWT con expiración de 24h
  • HTTPS en producción
  • Bloqueo tras 5 intentos fallidos
end note

@enduml
